WEBVTT

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.970
Can you imagine...

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:41.230
...a life in which you could
never touch the one you love?

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:44.060
He takes the life of whatever he touches.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.530
That was the curse the witch put on him.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.780
Plants, animals... and people
are no exception, of course.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:55.240
Regarding her son, doomed to live his life
without knowing the warmth of another,

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.000
his mother only complained.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.410
"That child is like Death incarnate..."

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.330
...she said.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:04.670
I'm sorry, I just can't
go through with it.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:12.840
Perhaps I turned her down too harshly.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.560
I hope I didn't hurt her feelings.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:18.930
Oh, come in!

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.350
Pardon the intrusion, Your Grace.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:25.770
Some new books have arrived,
so we came to add them to your collection.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:30.240
Thanks. Okay then, could you
arrange them by genre?

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.900
Very well, Your Grace.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.870
She looked away.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:43.580
But wait, last night... things seemed
to be going pretty well...

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:49.710
Let's go back to that spot in another
ten years to watch the meteor shower.

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.970
No, I must be overthinking this.

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:56.140
What if she thinks I'm
avoiding her instead?

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:00.270
Uh, Alice, something's
different about you today.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:03.270
Did you cut your hair?
Or change your makeup...?

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.730
I can't reach the upper shelves...

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:07.400
I'll take care of it.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.650
Thank you so much.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.860
S-Say, Alice...

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.610
Uh...

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.490
Hey... Don't you think...

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:20.410
...the space between us...
is a bit unusual...?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.250
I know... I can't touch you, but...

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.750
Alice, would you stop avoiding me?

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.000
I'm not avoiding you.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.380
You are, too!
Normally, you're more like:

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.800
"Why don't you check <i>me </i>out
instead of these books?"

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.840
That's your style, is it not?

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.430
What are you talking about?

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.640
You've got a lot of guts
to play dumb like that!

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.640
I won't have you saying things
about me that aren't true.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.100
So, am I right in thinking that...

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.690
...you're upset about what happened
at the lake last night?

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:51.440
Come on, I'm totally
defenseless right now.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:55.240
Normally, you'd be able to sexually harass
me three times in the space of 15 seconds.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.530
Come on, now!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.660
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.490
Now please, let me get back to my work.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.950
No, that's not what
you'd say! You'd say:

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.290
"You're an insatiable one, aren't you?"

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.540
Am I right?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.250
What the heck is wrong with <i>you</i>, Alice?!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.510
What on earth is wrong
with you, Your Grace?

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.840
I knew it. There's something different
than usual about Alice, don't you think?

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:22.260
She appears to me to be
nothing other than her usual self.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:26.640
If Alice doesn't start sexually harassing
me like she normally does, I'll...

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.900
I believe I've gotten a brief insight
into your tastes, Your Grace.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:35.780
No, I simply can't believe that
Alice would reject me so easily.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.160
There must be some kind
of explanation for it.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.500
A-Alice?

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.870
Rob?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:51.630
Could you touch Alice... for me?

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:55.010
Your Grace, what a thoroughly
unwholesome thing to suggest!

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.300
No, her forehead, her forehead!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.510
To think you'd caught a cold...

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.810
Forgive me.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.850
I knew I was sick, but I didn't think
it would interfere with my work.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.600
You didn't look sick at all,
so it came as a complete surprise.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.690
You fell into the lake last night,
so I guess it stands to reason that...

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:16.400
No, it was probably the
result of later that night...

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.990
...when I went to your window
to peer at you as you slept...

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.280
...and caught a chill in the night air.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.910
Would you stop peeking
into people's bedrooms?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.460
Well, in any case, you must return
to your room, Your Grace.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.000
You'll catch my cold.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.170
No, I'll stay by your side.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.840
My curse makes it impossible for me
to nurse you to back to health,

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.670
so the best I can do
is just stay by your side.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:42.140
I thought I could give you some moral
support while you're feeling weak.

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.140
Is that okay?

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:47.720
All right, you should get to
sleep soon. You look flushed.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.060
I bet your fever's gotten worse.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.570
It's got nothing to do with my cold...

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.490
Episode 4

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.960
It's so chilly... It's going to get
really cold tonight.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.260
Rob said we'll get some snow soon.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.800
That explains it.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.430
Here, let me warm your hands, Your Grace.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.260
Sticking them there isn't
going to warm them up!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.260
And I can't touch you in the first place!

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.310
Still, I hate it when it's cold out.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:53.600
It makes me feel even less
like going outside.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.060
And that's exactly why you must brave
the cold and learn to tolerate it.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.110
So, how about we play
in the snow tomorrow?

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.770
You can count me out.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.190
I'm sorry, but I'm going to stay in--

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.660
It looks great on you.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:10.410
I've never seen this scarf before.
Did you knit it?

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:14.080
Yes, I made it for you, Your Grace.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.960
It smells really nice.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:20.000
So, why don't you put that on tomorrow,
and we'll go outside and have fun?

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.670
Yeah, all right.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.340
Promise?

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:24.760
Promise.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.160
Wow!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.250
Everything's covered in snow!

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.420
Indeed, it is.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:04.210
Who wouldn't get a little
excited seeing this? Whoops!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:08.590
Plus... Alice is just the cutest
surrounded by all this snow.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.140
It makes me feel so good.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.720
Take that! Cold, huh?

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.930
You got me all wet...

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.650
Oh, dear.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.480
What are you doing, Your Grace?

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.610
Oh, Rob, it's you.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:28.450
Sorry. We shouldn't be goofing around
so much just because it snowed.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.160
Please let me join you.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.570
That's why you're here?

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.580
I thought it'd be dangerous
for the two of you alone.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.700
So, you want to build a snowman, huh?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.380
Anyhow, you mustn't let
yourself have too much fun.

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.340
Says the guy who's having the most fun...

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:48.760
Okay then, why don't we give him a hand?
Let's roll some snowballs.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:50.630
Yes, Your Grace.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:08:59.980
Okay, are you ready?

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.020
Roll it in time with me.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:06.110
One, two. One, two.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:09.950
Your Grace, you're going too fast.
Could you go a little slower?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.160
She says in a strangely seductive way...

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.120
I guess we have no other choice.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.290
This is rather dull work, so why don't
you take a break, Your Grace?

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.660
What a bummer!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.130
Well, if I can't join them, then...

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.420
What the--?! That was
straight out of <i>The Matrix</i>!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.840
You may have tried to catch me off guard,
but that's not going to happen.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.010
Prepare to be fired upon.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.720
Hey! That's an awful lot of return fire!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:39.520
And what... superb... control you have!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.810
Two can play at that game!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:57.990
His Grace really has begun
to smile more often...

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:01.580
All right, Rob, you lose!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.670
Let's get out of here!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.060
Oh man, that was so much fun!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.940
Even my panties are soaking wet.

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:30.860
I'll do the laundry.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:33.110
Please take off your clothes
and get in the tub right away.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:33.820
Nuh-uh!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.650
I beg your pardon?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.320
I'm not taking off this scarf.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.910
You made it especially for me.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:41.200
It's just until it dries.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.250
But I don't wanna!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.460
Oh, no!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.760
My mother's earring...

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.800
I've got to find it.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.710
Darn it all! The snow's getting worse.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:13.590
What a huge mansion!
Could it be an aristocrat's villa?

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.590
I'll get them to share some food with me.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.050
Or maybe...

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:21.100
...I'll just take it by force.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.890
Hey...

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.270
Hey, you! Are you all right?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:33.730
Ugh... Was I... asleep?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.980
Huh?! Wh-Who are you?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.410
So you've come to. Need a hand?

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:45.290
I've been cursed by a witch.
I take the life of whatever I touch.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:48.460
Don't worry, I can get up on my own.

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:51.040
Do you live in this mansion?

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.340
What were you doing out in this blizzard?

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.210
I was looking for something.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:59.340
My maid lost one of her precious
earrings out here today.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.550
You'd go through all this for a maid?

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:02.890
Yeah, I would.

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:07.180
Alice is a very special person to me,
so I've got to find it.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.520
Impressive.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.810
You're a girl, aren't you?

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.770
What were you doing out in the
woods in this snowy weather?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.610
I got separated from my childhood friend,

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:18.650
got lost, and wound up
here at this mansion.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:23.740
I'm starving, so I was just about ready
to shake you guys down for some food.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.830
It's scary how casually
you just said that!

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.870
The shovel's stuck...

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:36.210
My hands are starting to go numb.
This may be all I can take...

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.960
Why don't you call it quits?

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.260
You'll find it next spring
when the snow melts.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:44.600
No, it'll be all rusty by then.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:50.230
Besides, I want to see how
delighted she'll look when I...

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.730
This guy's got a lot of promise.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.190
I guess I should do something for him.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.660
So nice and warm...

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.410
I mean, darn that's hot!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.370
Are you awake now?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.500
Wh-Where's the snow?

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.090
I found what you were looking for.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.800
Are you satisfied?

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.720
I was going to go without
introducing myself,

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:25.010
but then I thought it wouldn't be polite.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.760
The name's Cuff.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.260
I'm a witch.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:35.230
Would you happen to know
where His Grace went?

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:46.620
Oh... so you can't break
the curse on me.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.740
No, it's beyond my power.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.160
Anyway, are you sure
it's okay to let me in?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.700
I am a witch, you know.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:56.420
I'd like to thank you, and besides,
there's so much I want to ask you.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:59.550
Also, you should meet my maid
and butler before you go.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:02.880
Who's that?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.430
Oh, let me introduce her to you.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:05.720
This is my maid...

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.890
Alice Lendrott.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.350
This is Cuff.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.390
She came to my rescue when I got covered
in snow and nearly died out there.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.980
Your Grace, I can't believe you went
outside in spite of the danger

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.730
after I told you so many times not to.

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:22.480
I'm really sorry!
But we found your earring. See?

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:27.280
It makes me happier to see you're
all right, Your Grace. I mean it.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.410
Alice, I'm sorry I made you worry.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:33.370
Not at all. Thank you
for finding my earring.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.370
I want to take a shower.
Show me how to use it.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.580
Huh?! That came out of nowhere!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:42.050
Please wait in the library, Your Grace.
I'll be there shortly.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.340
What's taking her so long?

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:54.140
Maybe it wasn't so safe to leave
her alone with the witch.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.020
Or maybe...

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:58.020
...the two of them are taking
a shower together?

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.270
Let me wash your back.

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:03.690
Ooh, I'm so jealous!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:10.450
♪ In a paradise full of bubbles ♪

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:15.950
♪ Your weariness and the grime on your
back both get washed away ♪

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:21.210
♪ Just think how great it'd be ♪

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:26.670
♪ To be able to touch ♪

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:31.010
♪ That glistening, smooth fair skin ♪

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.770
♪ Rub a dub dub! ♪

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:37.230
Sorry to have kept you
waiting, Your Grace.

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:38.690
N-No problem!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.520
That nice, hot shower really hit the spot.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:46.990
And Alice here is going
to mend my tattered robe.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.900
Is that so?

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:54.660
You really saved my hide.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.830
After my friend and I got
separated in the woods,

00:16:56.830 --> 00:17:00.120
I hadn't eaten anything
for two whole days.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.790
Is this friend of yours a witch? A woman?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.260
No, he's a guy. Sometimes
men are called witches,

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:09.970
but that can get confusing,
so let's just say he's a magic user.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.970
Look, I feel for you and all,

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:15.350
but I can't tell you
anything about our kind.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:18.680
You won't get a word out of me
even if you torture me.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.440
Well, I wasn't planning on
doing anything like that...

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:25.190
Now now, don't be like that, Cuff.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.480
Would you care for some dessert?

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:36.120
So, what do you want
to know about witches?

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:42.370
Well, uh... I thought you might know
something about the witch who cursed me.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.920
Is it really okay to talk about it?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:47.210
Since I ate all this food,
I guess I don't have much of a choice.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.170
She sure is a straight shooter.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:52.680
I'm sorry, but I don't know
a thing about your curse.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.140
It's not like we witches
are all pals or anything,

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:57.810
and if it didn't happen recently, it's
even less likely anyone knows about it.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.230
Oh. That makes sense.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:04.400
The only other thing I could talk
about would be myself, I guess.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.560
About you?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.650
You know about the witch hunts, right?

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.690
Humans have been conducting them
for quite some time.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:16.160
Well, there are still some radical groups
that are going around killing witches.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:20.160
If we used our magic,
we could make them pay.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.960
But there are just so many humans.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:26.750
My friend and I both lost
our parents to witch hunters.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:27.920
Really?

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.010
Those guys don't care who they kill.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:34.510
You see, my father... was human.

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:40.390
Being half-witch and half-human,
I grew up being shunned by both groups.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:43.440
I haven't attended a witches'
sabbath in quite a while.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.900
I know there's no place I belong,

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:49.020
but that's okay as long
as my friend's with me.

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:53.400
Don't come near me, you monster!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:56.530
You've got some grit, Cuff.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:02.500
You should hate me for being human,
but instead, you chose to save me.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.750
It doesn't matter whether
you're human or a witch.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.670
It was your determination
that aroused my interest.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.720
I've finished mending your robe.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:17.800
Wow! It's just like new!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:22.680
Do all witches have robes like that?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:27.440
Huh? Not all of them do, but I doubt
any humans possess them.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:30.770
Hey, Cuff, is there anything
else you can tell us?

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.860
Like, some kind of hint about
how to break this curse?

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.740
Now hold on, there!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.990
I'm not the sharpest tool in the shed.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.240
Huh?

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:43.120
That's not what I think,
but it's what my friend says.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.330
Honestly, all this maneuvering
is a real pain,

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.500
and I'm afraid I might tell
you something I shouldn't.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:53.420
See? All this thinking has
given me a headache! Ouch!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:56.130
Well, getting mad at me
isn't going to help...

00:19:56.130 --> 00:20:00.470
At times like these, it's my friend
who does the thinking.

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:03.600
He always makes the right decision.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.560
Well, it sounds like you've
got a lot of faith in him.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:09.690
I guess you're quite fond of him.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.410
Huh?!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.150
You're no noble, so don't be
hanging around the estate.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:53.320
Pauper!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.700
Alice, look at me.

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:02.530
There's still some snow on you.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.660
Y-Your Grace...

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:07.250
I'm sorry for what my friends did.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.500
I'll give them a good
tongue-lashing later.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.750
You look really good in the snow.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.050
Just like a snow fairy.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:31.310
Alice, what are you up to this morning?
You'll catch another cold.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.650
I was just feeling a little sentimental.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:35.820
You do some pretty strange things, too.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:38.150
Come on, let's go inside now.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:42.700
Wh-What's wrong?

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.490
Nothing's wrong, Your Grace.
Shall we head back?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:57.170
You looked like you wanted me to hold
you close, and it took me by surprise.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:06.010
Every time my love for you grows,
I feel like my heart will burst.

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:44.950
You look wonderful in the snow.

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:47.200
Just like a snow fairy.

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.120
Huh? What are you laughing for?

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:54.460
You haven't changed a bit, Your Grace.

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:56.670
Hey! Huh?

00:23:56.670 --> 00:23:59.420
Your Grace, I truly adore you.

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:02.800
Hey, you aren't teasing me again, are you?

00:24:02.800 --> 00:24:04.800
Come on, Alice. Say something.

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:10.640
"The Duke, a Crow, and Ice Skating."
